spell_flavour_text = "Brief. Concentrated. The kind of force that doesn't ask permission."
theory_desc = "Impulse-Momentum Theorem (J = Δp = FΔt). Short-duration high-force mana projectile — prioritising speed over sustained damage. Pierces because force is concentrated in a narrow time window (high F, low Δt), matching penetrating impact physics over blunt force.
Synergy: Third Law Impact staggers → Impulse Burst punishes the recovery window."
